ANSI C header files

IPW requires the following ANSI C header files:

	float.h
	limits.h

If your system already has these files, copy or [symbolically] link them to
this directory -- IPW WON'T find them unless they're here.

Preconfigured versions of <float.h> and <limits.h> for various existing IPW
hosts may be found in the subdirectories "conf.float" and "conf.limits",
respectively.  See the README file therein.

